# Operator-surface walkthrough (campaign)

Operator-readable copy:
`pim-offline-server/docs/dev/operator-surface-walkthrough-plan.md`.

## The rule

> **When this campaign is invoked, inventory every operator GUI class
> present this run (not SPA-only), classify each surface honestly, fix
> dumb mistakes and workflow holes in vertical slices, and prove the
> running product — never chrome, never Windows-only as “all platforms.”
> Walk + implement on Grok or AUTO. Opus is one rendered-acceptance
> (or failed-fix diagnosis) pass per named artifact. Flip English (US)
> ↔ German on every inventory class that has a locale switch; leftover
> English on German is a defect — wrap in `t()` and land DE catalog
> keys in the same change set. Do not stall. Parallelize only on
> disjoint ownership. Pending stays pending.**

