| **Models** | Walk + classify + implement: `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast` or AUTO. Omit `model` on `Task` unless pinning Grok. Opus **only** for rendered-GUI acceptance of a **named** screenshot / bounding-box after a cheaper pass, or diagnosis after that pass failed. **One Opus pass per defect.** No Opus fleet, no Opus supervisor, no Opus inheritance (expensive parent **must** pin Grok/AUTO on children). |
| **Stall recovery** | Git first. One slice per worker. Two Read/Grep-only turns → DONE checklist. Child stuck (“planning next moves”, no tools) → interrupt **once** (stop-planning) → abandon → finish in parent or **one** AUTO replacement. No explore fan-out while a sibling is stuck. ~10 minutes with no mutation → classify BLOCKED / Partial and move on. |
