## Model mix (binding)

Walk, classify, implement, locale flip, string harvest, and pack edits
on Grok or AUTO ([`auto-model-only.mdc`](auto-model-only.mdc)). The
narrow Opus carve-out in
[`essential-ui-actions-must-be-visible.mdc`](essential-ui-actions-must-be-visible.mdc)
still applies: Opus reviews a **rendered** artifact or diagnoses a
layout defect a cheaper pass already failed — including a German
screenshot that is unreadable or clipped. Do not sacrifice quality to
finish faster — unverified claims stay **pending** with the blocker
named.

## All platforms

Inventory and walk **every operator GUI class present**, not SPA-only:

| Class | Examples |
| --- | --- |
| Admin SPA (embedded) | AIC Server admin UI served by the running binary |
| Win32 configurators / elevate | Server and agent configurators, elevate helpers |
| Tauri shells | Same product family in Tauri |
| Linux / macOS equivalents | When those binaries exist **this run** |

Record **N/A — no seat/binary** with evidence (path missing, not built,
not installed). Never green a Windows-only walk as “all platforms.”
Apply the English (US) ↔ German flip on **each** class that has a
locale switch this run; **N/A — no locale switch** is allowed only
with evidence, never by skipping native GUIs after an SPA-only flip.

## Anti-stall (hard)

- Git first, one slice per worker, no full-plan re-read
  ([`agent-slice-discipline.mdc`](agent-slice-discipline.mdc)).
- Stop after two Read/Grep-only turns; deliver a DONE checklist
  (done / deferred / blocked).
- Parent: if a child is stuck, interrupt **once** with a stop-planning
  prompt; then abandon; finish in the parent or **one** AUTO replacement
  ([`stuck-agent-supervisor.mdc`](stuck-agent-supervisor.mdc)).
- No retry loops on structural failure (same compile / hook / tree
  error repeating). Switch approach or mark BLOCKED.
- Time-box a page: if no mutation in ~10 minutes, classify BLOCKED /
  Partial and move on.

## Parallelism (fast but safe)

- Parent max **two** concurrent `generalPurpose` / `explore` workers.
- Split only on **disjoint** areas (example: live-session chrome vs
  Report Center vs a Win32 configurator). Never two writers on the
  same `ui/src` file.
- Shared working tree: explicit-path commit early; never stash /
  reset / `checkout -- .`
  ([`shared-working-tree-is-not-yours.mdc`](shared-working-tree-is-not-yours.mdc)).
- **One deploy owner** at a time for `aic-server-service` / UI embed.
  Serialize deploys; parallelize diagnosis and non-overlapping edits.
- Internal worker split is OK if that worker owns disjoint paths.

## Walk method

1. **Inventory** routes, menus, and binaries present this run.
2. **Classify** each: Live / Partial / weird-half / dead / N/A.
   Screenshot or bounding-box required to claim visible / working
   ([`essential-ui-actions-must-be-visible.mdc`](essential-ui-actions-must-be-visible.mdc)).
3. **Fix** dumb mistakes and workflow holes in **vertical slices**
   (one workflow per slice — example: live session Disconnect + File
   transfer honesty).
4. **Locale flip (required):** English (US) ↔ German on every
   inventory class (see Localization flip below). Flag leftover
   English on DE; fix code + DE packs in the same change set.
5. **Deploy:** UI changes = no `-SkipUiBuild`; prove disk = served
   ([`shipped-means-served.mdc`](shipped-means-served.mdc)). Debug
   profile. No `cargo clean`. Leave the server service Running unless
   a recycle is required. Lab rotation identities stay in the docs/dev
   plan — never the operator’s personal account.
6. **Proof bars** — no false green:
   - Connect / Open / Launch → protocol surface
     ([`session-connect-protocol-surface.mdc`](session-connect-protocol-surface.mdc));
     comprehensive PAM also needs the protocol × workstation-type
     matrix
     ([`workstation-protocols-and-command-restrictions.mdc`](workstation-protocols-and-command-restrictions.mdc)).
   - Assessment Binder → section bodies, live IAM
     ([`assessment-binder-section-content.mdc`](assessment-binder-section-content.mdc)).
   - Messaging / email / approver notify → real inbox
     ([`mailpit-messaging-comprehensive-test.mdc`](mailpit-messaging-comprehensive-test.mdc)).
   - Locale flip → leftover English on German flagged and fixed, or
     honest Partial with named strings (see Localization flip).
7. **Commit + push** per slice (explicit paths). Slack the operator
   after each cluster if the Slack helper exists
   ([`slack-webhook-agent-access.mdc`](slack-webhook-agent-access.mdc)).

